      "statement": "Before validating, an agent must be able to state from the repository alone the component's owner server and target IP, role, current build state, architectural layer, applicable baseline rules, required vs validation-only dependencies, BASE PASS boundary, and required prior PASS evidence; if any is unclear, stop and resolve ecosystem context first.",
