    {
      "id": "claim_8c6ee97be0e941d5be553d6903a0c4d9",
      "statement": "CentCom smoke-runner activation (proof step A5) occurs only after HX-5's own base inference (A4) plus base/domain/GPU, reboot persistence, toolset/bootstrap, hx-smoke-doctor, and a remote known-good HX-2 probe all pass. After A5, HX-5 is the standard remote execution station; subsequent tests run over LAN/API/protocol/native-client/UI, with approved SSH only an exception when local execution is intrinsic. DeepSeek Harness is not a prerequisite for activation.",
      "evidence": [
        {
