      "id": "claim_a8e69d29fa2e4d5195782c33e2af3b7c",
      "statement": "For pre-CentCom roadmap steps A1-A4, the runner runs from the operator station by exporting HX_SMOKE_ALLOW_HOST to the hostname and HX_ECO_REPO to the repo checkout; the station used is recorded in runner_host. After A5 passes these variables must be unset so a later run cannot pick up stale authorization.",
