    {
      "id": "claim_049edece212641eba8651e5eaad9807e",
      "statement": "The tools/hx-smoke-runner/ helpers hx-smoke-doctor, hx-smoke-new, hx-smoke-ui-capture, and hx-smoke-promote are extensionless entry points (not indexed by graft) that validate the toolchain, create a timestamped run + manifest from a committed smoke-test authority, capture direct-LAN UI evidence only after expected text is visible, and enforce the proof DAG to promote PASS — without deploying applications, creating permanent integration, or auto-committing.",
      "evidence": [
