    {
      "id": "claim_f383447ffd8c4e71bcb6c935cf998e49",
      "statement": "hx-smoke-promote enforces the proof DAG for PASS: it re-derives and re-binds proof_step from the manifest, refuses if the step is NOT_EXECUTABLE in hx-proof.tsv, and for each dependency in the step's Requires column requires both that the dependency's TSV status is PASS and that prior_pass_evidence contains a '<dep> -> <evidence>' entry. There is no bypass flag; a required prior step that has not passed or is not cited refuses promotion.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/hx-smoke-runner/hx-smoke-promote#L111-L194",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:67e5912031d190cba6e5d39f97423636ea5dfdaae4c1f230348aad37933aaf92:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_40b6e9c6484443a9a2900d79d7e75386",
      "statement": "hx-smoke-promote re-hashes the procedure copy against the smoke_test_sha256 recorded by hx-smoke-new; a mid-run change to the acceptance authority aborts promotion, enforcing that an AI agent must not modify acceptance criteria inside an in-progress run and must instead correct the authority in a separate reviewed change and start a new run ID.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/hx-smoke-runner/hx-smoke-promote#L69-L88",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:afa17709e9c8690079a271f844d84bceacd7b525b970d29a67949e6ef3b80adc:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5d9cdf75693941c9aa3b5ceaa1b23489",
      "statement": "On PASS, hx-smoke-promote requires FUNCTIONAL=PASS, CLEANUP=PASS or NOT_APPLICABLE, both proof-chain fields resolved, and component_version_or_revision/transport_or_endpoint/sut_ip recorded; it screens the promotion set for obvious credential patterns, stamps final status and UTC end, copies the normalized bundle to docs/05-evidence/<sut>/<component>/<run-id>/, and never auto-commits — it prints the next step as an explicit review+commit.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/hx-smoke-runner/hx-smoke-promote#L216-L251",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:82191b0bcf0ced1cfbe7fa545d56410d8f23b88fab369590efdb957f0b588ac7:"
