    {
      "id": "claim_b72793b30c124fd59842524a49240ea2",
      "statement": "The prior_pass_evidence manifest field requires one '<step-id> -> <evidence>' entry per step in the roadmap Requires column, separated by ';', on a single line; hx-smoke-promote reads only the inline value, so an indented multi-line value reads as empty and a bare list of paths is refused because it cannot say which path proves which dependency. Use NONE only when genuinely nothing is required.",
