    {
      "id": "claim_e6c8386a316d43ffa08acc7f2f8218a7",
      "statement": "Cleanup and cleanup verification are mandatory parts of PASS: the SUT must not be left with test scripts, Python envs, fixture libraries, runner deps, manifests, or evidence bundles, and teardown must be verified by re-querying the SUT. A functional PASS with failed or unverified cleanup keeps the overall run FAIL/INCOMPLETE and cannot close BASE PASS.",
