    {
      "id": "claim_95bcb43ee24a4c269ad0525cead8a618",
      "statement": "HX has two accepted evidence shapes: inline record evidence for HX-1/HX-2/HX-3 (closed before CentCom, recorded inside docs/02-server-records/ and accepted as prior_pass_evidence), and run-bundle evidence for HX-4 onward created by hx-smoke-new and promoted by hx-smoke-promote under docs/05-evidence/<server>/<component>/<run-id>/. A later PASS never overwrites a materially useful failed run; retries get new run IDs.",
